sequenceDiagram
  actor Client
  participant Rest as module-rest-controller<br/>AuthController
  participant Login as module-auth<br/>LoginService
  participant Core as module-core<br/>auth contracts
  participant Pending as PendingLoginRegistry
  participant Kafka as Kafka
  participant Msg as module-pipeline-messaging
  participant External as module-external-api<br/>AuthCharacterFetchHandler
  participant NexonClient as module-nexon-client<br/>USER_BYOK
  participant Nexon as Nexon OpenAPI
  participant Session as SessionCacheService
  participant Jwt as JwtGeneratorService

  Client->>Rest: POST /api/v6/auth/login
  Rest->>Login: login(apiKey, userIgn)
  Login->>Core: create CharacterFetchRequest
  Login->>Pending: register(eventId)
  Login-)Kafka: auth-character-fetch-request
  Kafka->>Msg: deliver record
  Msg->>External: sanitized DeliveryContext
  External->>NexonClient: getCharacterList(apiKey)
  NexonClient->>Nexon: BYOK request
  Nexon-->>NexonClient: character list or typed failure
  NexonClient-->>External: neutral character model
  External-)Kafka: auth-character-fetch-response
  Kafka->>Pending: AuthResponseConsumer.complete(response)
  Pending-->>Login: complete login future

  alt Nexon response rejected
    Login-->>Rest: 401 LoginRejectedException
    Rest-->>Client: authentication failure
  else valid account and character
    Login->>Core: derive fingerprint and create Session
    Login->>Session: find cached session
    alt session cache hit
      Session-->>Login: existing session
    else cache miss
      Login->>Session: save new session
    end
    Login->>Jwt: generate signed token
    Jwt-->>Login: JWT
    Login-->>Rest: LoginResult
    Rest-->>Client: token + session metadata
  end

  Note over Msg,External: Technical retry, DLT sanitization, and safe ACK are owned by module-pipeline-messaging.
